538
00:34:02,799 --> 00:34:04,920
Once you go further and experience more,

539
00:34:05,960 --> 00:34:06,839
you'll come to understand

540
00:34:06,839 --> 00:34:07,400
that everyone

541
00:34:08,199 --> 00:34:09,880
