552
00:35:27,639 --> 00:35:31,840
Let youth blow through your long hair

553
00:35:31,840 --> 00:35:35,719
Let it guide your dreams

554
00:35:36,639 --> 00:35:40,239
Unknowingly, the history of this city

555
00:35:40,239 --> 00:35:44,039
