Hold on.

571
00:38:35,199 --> 00:38:36,519
Is this a bug

572
00:38:36,679 --> 00:38:38,039
or a tracker or something?

573
00:38:38,360 --> 00:38:40,199
Such a sneaky little trick

574
00:38:40,199 --> 00:38:42,199
doesn't seem like Yu Songfan's idea.

575
00:38:42,199 --> 00:38:43,519
Was it you?

576
00:38:46,119 --> 00:38:47,440
Just keep driving.

577
00:38:49,119 --> 00:38:49,920
Yes, sir.

578
00:38:51,239 --> 00:38:52,079
It's gone.

579
00:38:55,679 --> 00:38:57,000
Ding Ning's signal dropped.

580
00:38:57,760 --> 00:38:58,920
He wants to use you

581
00:38:58,920 --> 00:39:01,159
to wear away the last of my faith,

582
00:39:01,159 --> 00:39:02,920
and turn me completely into him.

583
00:39:04,119 --> 00:39:05,719
This is a long-range tracking and listening device.

584
00:39:06,480 --> 00:39:08,039
If you're really that worried,

585
00:39:08,559 --> 00:39:09,800
you can use this to find me.

586
00:39:11,360 --> 00:39:12,079
Find out

587
00:39:12,079 --> 00:39:13,480
which road the signal disappeared on.

588
00:39:13,760 --> 00:39:14,199
Got it.

589
00:39:18,840 --> 00:39:19,360
Found it.

590
00:39:20,800 --> 00:39:21,719
Near this road,

591
00:39:21,719 --> 00:39:23,199
there are three locations of interest.

592
00:39:23,719 --> 00:39:24,599
An abandoned stadium,

593
00:39:25,119 --> 00:39:26,239
the old cave wine cellar,

594
00:39:26,480 --> 00:39:27,159
and the farm.

595
00:39:47,440 --> 00:39:48,039
They're here.

596
00:40:04,079 --> 00:40:04,880
Let's go.

597
00:40:30,039 --> 00:40:31,119
Well, well.

598
00:40:32,239 --> 00:40:33,960
Starting the party without me?

599
00:40:34,960 --> 00:40:35,719
Mr. Bi.

600
00:40:36,960 --> 00:40:37,639
They're here.

601
00:40:38,119 --> 00:40:38,800
Ding Ning.

602
00:40:39,199 --> 00:40:40,960
This is Mr. Bi.
